  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RBM Support to SITE FREE Network</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">RBM st&#xf6;d till SITE&apos;s FREE N&#xe4;tverk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen omfattar upphandling av RBM-st&#xf6;d till SITE enligt rangordnat ramavtal. RBM-st&#xf6;det avser st&#xf6;d till utarbetandet av resultatramverk till ans&#xf6;kan samt st&#xf6;d till resultat uppf&#xf6;ljning och rapportering under projektet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contributions includes the procurement of RBM-support to SITE in accordance with Sida&apos;s framework agreement. The RBM-support includes support with the elaboration of a results framework for the application as well as support to results monitoring and reporting.</narrative>
  </description>
